  |   data coff_pdb_link.GTypeAt array of int64
  |   data coff_pdb_link.LExePath string
  |   data coff_pdb_link.LExe array of uint8
  |   data coff_pdb_link.LPdb array of uint8
  |   data coff_pdb_link.LReader ref MsfReader
